---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Camp Queerness: Queer Summer Camp for Grownups in Tulum | Queerness Experiences" description={"Camp Queerness is a queer summer camp for grownups in Tulum: kayaking, dancing, singing, painting, and sharing stories in the Sian Ka'an biosphere reserve. Led by Santi Solis, born in Mexico and raised between two cultures. For sapphic, queer, and trans travelers who want the real thing."}>

<header class="head">
  <div class="shape-y"></div>
  <p class="head-eye">★ Camp Queerness · Tulum</p>
  <h1>A Queer Summer<br>Camp for Grownups.</h1>
  <p>Camp Queerness: overnight camp, reimagined for sapphic, queer, and trans adults.</p>
  <div class="hero-grid" style="margin-top:var(--s-md);">
    <img src="/images/camp-queerness-picnic.jpg" alt="Friends painting together over a spread of fresh fruit in the jungle near Tulum" style="object-position:center 15%;">
    <img src="/images/IMG_1374.jpeg" alt="Swinging out over a cenote on a Camp Queerness trip in Tulum">
    <img src="/images/IMG_3762.jpeg" alt="Birdwatching near a lagoon in Tulum">
    <img src="/images/22943efe-94cd-4c5a-b7bd-48c4afb5ba28.jpg" alt="Friends laughing together over drinks in Tulum">
  </div>
</header>

<!-- "WHAT THESE TRIPS ACTUALLY ARE" — pulled 2026-09-12, written for multiple group trips, doesn't fit Camp Queerness alone. Full markup preserved in git history, may reuse pieces of this copy elsewhere later. -->

<section style="background:var(--bone);padding:var(--s-lg) var(--s-sm);">
  <div class="trips-about-inner" style="max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;">
    <img src="/images/IMG_3942.jpeg" alt="Kayaking near Tulum" style="width:100%;border:3px solid var(--dark);box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--yellow);aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;">
    <p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--dark);">Kayaking through the Sian Ka'an biosphere reserve, dancing, singing, painting, eating incredible food, and sharing stories with people who get it. Created by Santi Solis, a queer, bilingual, and bicultural camp counselor at heart. I worked at camps most of my life and only ever got to go as a day camper myself, so this is the camp I always wanted. Being bicultural is what lets me bridge both worlds and give you the real thing, not a resort version of it.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CAMP QUEERNESS — the whole page is this, not boxed as one card among others -->
<section style="background:var(--white);padding:var(--s-lg) var(--s-sm);max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;">
  <p class="gstat" style="border-top:none;padding-top:0;margin:var(--s-sm) 0 var(--s-md);">Fun cultural nuance you'll learn: we don't just say "sí." There are a couple other options, one involves a finger, one involves an egg.</p>

  <ul class="trips-details-list">
    <li>Meals made with up to thirty ingredients, herbs and spices layered in ways you've never tasted.</li>
    <li>Why we still sing the songs our grandparents did, with just as much gusto, maybe more.</li>
    <li>How queer activism here carries different weight than in the U.S., shaped by histories still within living memory.</li>
    <li>Mexican ingenuity: how the most talented, creative people turn whatever's on hand into something magic, alive in Tulum's art and music scene.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="trips-about-grid" style="margin:var(--s-md) 0;">
    <img src="/images/group-trips-photo.jpg" alt="A group smiling together on a Queerness Experiences trip in Tulum">
    <img src="/images/IMG_4652.jpeg" alt="Friends swimming through the mangroves in Tulum">
    <img src="/images/IMG_2677.jpeg" alt="Friends at sunset on a dock in Tulum">
    <img src="/images/IMG_2244.jpeg" alt="Walking through the mangrove boardwalk in Tulum">
  </div>
</section>

<!-- QUEER CONNECT — paused, focusing on Camp Queerness. Full markup preserved in git history if reviving later. -->

<!-- LUXURY LESBIANS — paused for now, focusing on Camp Queerness. Card removed 2026-09-11, full markup preserved in git history if reviving later. -->

<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="faq" id="faq">
  <p class="sec-eye">Before you book</p>
  <h2>Questions about<br>Camp Queerness</h2>
  <div class="faq-list">
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq1" checked>
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq1">Who can join Camp Queerness?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Camp Queerness is specifically for queer, sapphic, and trans travelers. Period.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq-stay">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq-stay">Where will we be staying?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">We'll be staying at a nice villa in Tulum town. Even though it's called camp, we won't be camping, but we will be spending a lot of time outdoors.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq2">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq2">How is Camp Queerness different from a tour?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Tours are single-day experiences with just your group. Camp Queerness is an overnight camp that brings together travelers who don't already know each other yet, for a shared experience full of new places and new people.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq3">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq3">How is this different from other queer and sapphic trips?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">I'm a bicultural, bilingual, queer and trans UCLA-trained biologist, and I created Camp Queerness myself. That gives you insight into Mexico in a way you can only get from a local person. I've been running tours for queer and trans travelers here in Tulum for over three years.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq4">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq4">Do you host trips outside Tulum?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Not yet, but I have plans for a climbing trip in San Cristóbal de las Casas, plus trips to Colombia and Argentina, coming soon. If there's anywhere else you're interested in, let me know.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <input type="checkbox" id="gfaq5">
      <label class="faq-q" for="gfaq5">I'm bringing my group to Tulum, can you give me your local insight?<span class="tog">+</span></label>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Yes. If you're bringing a queer group to Tulum, reach out and I'll help you get local insight, connect you with local businesses and private chefs, or co-host with you. <a href="/bring-your-group">Let's plan it together →</a></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="background:var(--white);padding:0 var(--s-sm) var(--s-lg);text-align:center;">
  <a href="/waitlist" class="btn-p" style="display:inline-block;">Join the Waitlist →</a>
</section>

<!-- HOST CTA moved to /bring-your-group — keeping this page focused on one offer: Camp Queerness. -->

</Layout>

<style is:global>
@font-face{font-family:'CheddarGothicStencil';src:url('/fonts/CheddarGothicStencil.woff2') format('woff2');font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-display:swap;}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
html{overflow-x:hidden;max-width:100vw;}
:root{
  --magenta:#C8185A;--yellow:#F5A623;--terra:#B5390F;--dark:#1a1a18;
  --white:#FDFCF9;--bone:#F5F0E8;--muted:#4A4034;--border:rgba(26,26,24,0.12);
  --s-sm:16px;--s-md:32px;--s-lg:64px;
  --ff:'Archivo Black','Space Grotesk',sans-serif;--fb:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;
}
body{background:var(--bone);color:var(--dark);font-family:var(--fb);font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden;}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}

/* HEADER */
.head{background:var(--terra);padding:var(--s-md) var(--s-sm) var(--s-lg);position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
.shape-y{position:absolute;top:0;right:0;width:40%;height:50%;background:var(--yellow);clip-path:polygon(28% 0,100% 0,100% 100%,0 100%);z-index:0;}
.head-eye{font-family:var(--fb);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);margin-bottom:4px;position:relative;z-index:2;}
.head h1{font-family:var(--ff);font-size:40px;line-height:0.96;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--white);position:relative;z-index:2;-webkit-text-stroke:1.5px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);paint-order:stroke fill;margin-bottom:var(--s-sm);}
.head p{font-size:14.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);line-height:1.7;position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:520px;}
.head-hook{font-family:var(--fb);font-weight:700;font-size:16px !important;color:var(--white) !important;max-width:460px;margin-bottom:var(--s-sm);position:relative;z-index:2;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.35);border-left:3px solid var(--yellow);padding:10px 14px;}
.pull-quote{background:var(--bone);border:3px solid var(--dark);box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--yellow);padding:20px 24px;margin:var(--s-md) 0 0;font-family:var(--ff);font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;color:var(--dark);text-transform:uppercase;}
.trips-details-list{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-bottom:var(--s-md);}
.trips-details-list li{font-size:16px;font-weight:500;color:var(--dark);display:flex;gap:10px;line-height:1.55;}
.trips-details-list li::before{content:'→';color:var(--magenta);flex-shrink:0;font-weight:700;}

/* TRIPS */
.trips{padding:var(--s-md) var(--s-sm) var(--s-lg);}
.trip{border:3px solid var(--dark);margin-bottom:var(--s-md);box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--dark);overflow:hidden;background:var(--white);}
.trip-photo{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(26,26,24,0.05),rgba(26,26,24,0.05) 12px,rgba(26,26,24,0.09) 12px,rgba(26,26,24,0.09) 24px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(26,26,24,0.4);text-align:center;padding:12px;border-bottom:3px solid var(--dark);position:relative;}
.trip-photo-img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;}
.trip-status{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;font-family:var(--fb);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:5px 10px;border-right:3px solid var(--dark);border-bottom:3px solid var(--dark);}
.status-confirmed{background:var(--magenta);color:var(--white);}
.status-soon{background:var(--yellow);color:var(--dark);}
.trip-body{padding:20px;}
.trip-partner{font-family:var(--fb);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--magenta);margin-bottom:6px;}
.trip-name{font-family:var(--ff);font-size:26px;color:var(--dark);text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1;margin-bottom:12px;}
.trip-desc{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:var(--s-sm);}
.trip-detail{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:var(--s-sm);}
.detail-pill{font-family:var(--fb);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:4px 10px;background:var(--bone);border:2px solid var(--dark);color:var(--dark);}
.trip-foot{border-top:2px solid var(--border);padding-top:14px;}
.btn-trip{display:inline-block;background:var(--magenta);color:var(--white);font-family:var(--fb);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.05em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:11px 18px;border:2px solid var(--dark);box-shadow:3px 3px 0 var(--dark);}
.btn-trip-wait{display:inline-block;background:var(--white);color:var(--dark);font-family:var(--fb);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.05em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:11px 18px;border:2px solid var(--dark);box-shadow:3px 3px 0 var(--dark);}

footer{background:var(--dark);padding:var(--s-md) var(--s-sm);border-top:3px solid var(--yellow);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--s-sm);}
.flogo{font-family:var(--fb);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--magenta);line-height:1.15;}
.flinks{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:var(--s-sm);list-style:none;}
.flinks a{font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);}
.trips-about-inner{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--s-md);}
.trips-about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;}
.trips-about-grid img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1/1;object-fit:cover;border:3px solid var(--dark);}

@media(min-width:720px){
  nav{padding:0 40px;}
  .head{padding:var(--s-lg) 40px;}
  .head h1{font-size:60px;}
  .trips{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:28px;align-items:start;padding:var(--s-md) 40px var(--s-lg);max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;}
  .trip{margin-bottom:0;}
  .trips-about-inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 440px;gap:48px;align-items:center;}
  footer{flex-direction:row;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:var(--s-md) 40px;}
}
</style>
